# Fetched at build time from the pinned Initiative revision (SCHEMA_REF).
# Not committed: a document in two repositories drifts, a pinned ref does not.
schemas/app-manifest.json

# schemas/automation-block.json IS committed, and the asymmetry is not a
# preference. It is generated in the automation service, which is a private
# repository — there is no revision an install could fetch from, so the choice
# is between a committed copy and no offline validation at all. What stands in
# for the pinned ref is `npm run schema:automation -- --check`.
